  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mūlagi atamanīkile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūbonwa achile ng'wilaale ū mu sī īyo SEEBA Muluingu wako alīkwinha ībize yako, alīyo ū mūlagi ūbiza atamanīkile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a banamhala bing'we na a balamuji bakūja ū kwipandī lyenīlo bakabūlole ū būkūle wa kūfuma a ha mimba gwenūyo kūja ū kū mizengo īyo īlī kūūko kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma a banamhala ba mu mizengo īyo īlī hihī hihī henaho bakūsola ndogoosa ya ng'ombe īyo ītaalī kwandya milīmo nūūlū kūzwalīkījiwa ijoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ndogoosa yenīyo bakwīswaga būja nayo kwilago īlo lītaalī kūlīng'wa, ūko gūlīko na mongo gwa minzī gakūselaga. Ūlū būshika ū ng'wilago lyenīlo bīmyoola ī nhingo yayo ī ndogoosa yenīyo bībīnza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bagabīji, a ba lūganda lwa Lawī bakwegeela hihī, nguno abenabo ū SEEBA Mulungu wako abasolile kūtūmama nīmo gwakwe na kūbalombela a banhū mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA, na kūlamula mihayo yose nūūlū wilemeelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho pye a banamhala ba mu mizengo īyo īlī hihī nū mimba gwenūyo, bakūkalaba mu minzī a makono gabo, bakīngīlīgije a higūlya ya ndogoosa īyo yabūlagīlagwa ng'wilago bo kūbīnzwa nhingo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bakūhaya hape, “A makono gise gatagiitile a mininga geneya; na a miso gise gatagūbonile ū mhayo gwenūyū aho gūlīītwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "SEEBA, balekejage a banhū bako a Baisilaeli abo wabakomoola; nū būhūbi wa kwitwa miniga gatī na kabi ūtiūzūbūbalīla kū banhū bako a Baisilaeli; ni balekejiagwe ū būbi wa mininga genayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū mu gīko mukūwīnja, būng'wīngīle ū būbi wa kwitwa mininga gatī na shilingo, nguno mukūbiza ng'wītaga ya būtūngīlīja ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūtoola nkīma nsese",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūja kwilwisha būlūgū na banishi bako, hūna ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūbatūūla mu makono gako ūdima nding'wa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū mu bading'wa benabo ūlū ūbona mo nkīma wawiza ūūkūtoga, ūdūgije kūnsola abize nke wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wenhage ū mu ng'wako, ashike amooge ī nzwīlī jakwe, na maala gakwe agabbute; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī shizwalo īsho walī azwalile aho alīding'wa ashizuule. Ūlū wikala ū mu kaya yako ikanza lya ng'weji ngima akūbalīlaga a ba ise nū nina, a henaho lūūlū ūdūgije kūntoola ūbize ngoshi wakwe, nū wei abize nke wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū lyūshika ikanza ooya ū kūkūyeja, nekage aje ūko alatogwe wei ng'wenekīlī. Gwike yaya ū kūnjinja, nūūlū kūntūūla mu būsese, nguno wamalile kūntūūla mu kūdalahwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Īyo yigelile kwītīlwa bitūnja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū alī na mhalī ja bakīma babīlī, hūna ūntogwa ūmò wabo, alīyo ū ūngī ūhenwa, ūlū ū mu būbīlī wabo būmyalīla bitūnja, ū ng'witūnja wa kūbyalwa kwandya ūbiza wa nkīma ūyo ahenilwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na lūūlū ūlū lyūshika ikanza lya kūbagabanhya wingīji a bitūnja bakwe, ni ilang'hanage atizūntonja kū būtongi ū ng'witūnja wa nkīma ūyo antogilwe, gītī gīkī alī wa kwandya kūbyalwa, ū ng'witūnja wa kwandya kūbyalwa, ū wa ng'henwa ūntūūla kū numa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shing'wigelile kūzunya gīkī ū ng'witūnja wa kūbyalwa nū nkīma ū ng'henwa hū ng'wene ū ntaale, na lūūlū ang'winhe ng'hangala ibīlī ū ngabo gwa wingīji, gīt'ūmo īng'wigelilwe myalwa wa kwandya. Nguno ū ng'wenūyo hū ng'wene ū lūmeng'ho lwa nguzu ja ng'wa ise. Ū ngabo gwa wingīji gwa myalwa wa kwandya gūng'wigeleelilwe wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū alī na ng'witūnja ngūnu na shitiigwa, hama nambu ū kū ba ise nū nina, nīyo atabigwaga nū mu būhūgūji wabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a ba ise nū nina bakūndima bantwale kū mita gwa nzengo gwabo, kū būtongi wa banamhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū būshika a ha mita būbawīla a banamhala, “Ū ng'witūnja wise ng'wenūyū shitiigwa, nīyo hangī atī na būhamīle; alemile gete ū kūtwigwa ūlū tūlīng'hūgūla. Nīyo nkenaagūji no, na ng'wi wa mawalwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho pye a bagosha ba mu nzengo gwenūyo bakūmponda mawe kūshisha ache. Shiigelile ūwīnje gete ū būbi ū mu bing'we; a Baisilaeli a bose bigwe bogohe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbūlagwa na kūnungelejiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūhūba mhayo gwigeleelilwe kūbūlagwa, hūna ū mīlī gwakwe gūūnungelejiwa ha līntī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaya ū kūgūleka ū mīlī gwakwe gūnungeele kūshisha būjikū pe. Shiigelile ajīkwe ū lūshikū lwenūlo, nguno būlī ng'wene ū wa kūnungelejiwa azumilwe na Mulungu. Yaya ū kwīsosohaja ī sī yako īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha kūbiza ya wingīji wako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
